      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I just checked the current master of fcrepo4 versus the current master of the test suite.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "There seems to be a large block of tests failing in the 3.9.* area that are \"MUST\" or \"SHOULD\". every other test passes or is a \"MAY\". I don't know where this block of fail tests came from, whether I just missed them or they started failing",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
