      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a425248ef600739485d8",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I just checked the current master of fcrepo4 versus the current master of the test suite.</p>\n\n<p>There seems to be a large block of tests failing in the 3.9.* area that are \"MUST\" or \"SHOULD\". every other test passes or is a \"MAY\". I don't know where this block of fail tests came from, whether I just missed them or they started failing</p>",
