     "body": "<p>You will need to enable external content on your Fedora. I run the test suite against a Fedora that has been started with the following command:<br/>\n```<br/>\nmvn jetty:run -Dfcrepo.external.content.allowed=fcrepo-http-api/src/test/resources/allowed_external_paths.txt -Dfcrepo.auth.webac.userAgent.baseUri=<a href=\"http://example.com/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://example.com/</a> -pl fcrepo-webapp/<br/>\n```</p>",
