  "description": "<p>This task is to run the <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/Fedora-API-Test-Suite\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/Fedora-API-Test-Suite</a> against the `master` branch of fcrepo and analyze all of the failures for correctness.</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Start up Fedora from within the fcrepo4 project directory:<br/>\n&gt; mvn jetty:run -Dfcrepo.external.content.allowed=fcrepo-http-api/src/test/resources/allowed_external_paths.txt -pl fcrepo-webapp/</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Build the Test-Suite<br/>\n&gt; mvn clean install</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Run the Test-Suite<br/>\n&gt; java -jar target/testsuite-1.0-SNAPSHOT-shaded.jar -c config.yml.dist</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>For reference, my local results are:<br/>\n===============================================<br/>\nFedora API Specification Test Suite<br/>\nTotal tests run: 196, Failures: 17, Skips: 0<br/>\n===============================================</p>\n\n",
